Package: wan_iptv
Version: 1.0
Depends: libc, libssp, libubus-lua, libubox-lua, luafilesystem, neighm-tch
Source: feeds/technicolor/wan_iptv
Section: wan_iptv
Maintainer: Technicolor <linuxgw@technicolor.com>
Architecture: brcm63xx-tch
Installed-Size: 2542
Description:  This module is used to keep IPTV hosts in LAN to send/receive packets via the WAN IPTV interface, if the ISP can support WAN IPTV interface
 This module listen to UBUS path network.neigh and network.interface to maintain the iptables rules to meet the requirements.
